# LAYER 4 — IMPORTANT GOOGLE AI STUDIO CONSTRAINT

Do not assume the Android project has a traditional server-side runtime.

Google's current documentation states that AI Studio Android apps are client-side applications, while server-side runtime features such as server-side secrets and certain integrations are available for web apps. For Android, Google provides Firebase AI Logic and App Check for secure Gemini access without embedding a raw API key in the APK.

Therefore design the application around:

```text
ANDROID LOCAL RUNTIME
+
SECURE GEMINI ACCESS
+
DIRECT EXTERNAL DATA PROVIDERS
+
LOCAL DATABASE
+
LOCAL AGENT ORCHESTRATION
```

Do not create an unnecessary custom backend.

