# LAYER 10 — FRESHNESS STATES

Implement:

```text
LIVE
FRESH
LATEST_AVAILABLE
AGING
STALE
CURRENT_DATA_UNAVAILABLE
```

Definitions:

### LIVE

Current/near-current data appropriate for intraday use.

### FRESH

Within the appropriate freshness window.

### LATEST_AVAILABLE

The latest legitimate official publication even if older than 24 hours.

Example:

Quarterly financial statement.

### AGING

Approaching the permitted freshness boundary.

### STALE

Outside the permitted freshness boundary.

### CURRENT DATA UNAVAILABLE

Required information cannot be verified.

